Feature: Search for Trains
  As a passenger
  I want to search for train connections
  So that I can plan my journey

  Scenario: Successful one-way search
    Given I am on the RailWise homepage
    When I select "One-way" trip type
    And I enter "London" as the origin
    And I enter "Paris" as the destination
    And I click the "Search" button
    Then I should see a list of available trains


Feature: Dynamic Time-Based Pricing
  As a system
  I want to adjust ticket prices based on time of day
  So that I can offer Saver discounts during off-peak hours

  Scenario: Apply Saver discount for off-peak travel
    Given the base ticket price is 100.00 EUR
    When the user selects a train departing at "10:30"
    Then the system should identify the time as "Off-peak"
    And the final ticket price should be 95.00 EUR


Feature: Child and Family Discounts
  As a parent
  I want to apply a Family Rail Card
  So that I can get a discount for my child's ticket

  Scenario: Child traveling with Family Rail Card
    Given the passenger is a "Child" under 16
    And the passenger holds a "Family Rail Card"
    When the ticket price is calculated
    Then a 50% discount should be applied to the ticket
